| **JFK Airport Tours** | Airport experience | 0 km (on‑site) | Guided behind‑the‑scenes tours of terminals, runway view decks, and the famous “Tarmac Café.” |
| **Rockaway Beach** | Beach / Outdoor | 12 km (≈ 7 mi) | Sandy shoreline, boardwalk, cafés, and a spectacular sunset view of the Manhattan skyline. |
| **Queens Botanical Garden** | Garden / Nature | 13 km (≈ 8 mi) | 39‑acre garden with themed sections, a pond, and seasonal art installations – perfect for a peaceful stroll. |
| **Flushing Meadows‑Corona Park** | Park / Museum | 15 km (≈ 9 mi) | Home of the iconic **Unisphere**, the **Queens Museum**, and the **New York Hall of Science** – great for a quick cultural dip. |
| **Museum of the Moving Image** | Museum / Media | 16 km (≈ 10 mi) | Interactive exhibits on film, TV, and digital media; occasional screenings and special events. |
| **Jamaica Bay Wildlife Refuge** (Gateway National Recreation Area) | Wildlife / Bird‑watching | 18 km (≈ 11 mi) | Boardwalk trails, excellent fall‑migration bird‑watching, and serene water‑edge scenery. |

